TrustTunnel VPN plugin for OPNsense.

Hosts (Server tab) or joins (Client tab) a TrustTunnel VPN — an
HTTPS-disguised tunnel speaking HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, and HTTP/3 over TLS
or QUIC. Supports asymmetric site-to-site routing between two OPNsense
edge routers via a `tt://?...` deep-link with optional QR-code export.

WWW: https://github.com/mpanius/opnsense-trusttunnel
